/P 93 0 R
/T (The flowchart designed alongside the storyboard captured the system logic clearly: the user places cubes, the Arduino measures total resistance, that data is sent via Serial to TouchDesigner and Pure Data, the software identifies which combination is active, triggers the matching audiovisual response, and then loops back waiting for the next change.)
/E (The flowchart designed alongside the storyboard captured the system logic clearly: the user places cubes, the Arduino measures total resistance, that data is sent via Serial to TouchDesigner and Pure Data, the software identifies which combination is active, triggers the matching audiovisual response, and then loops back waiting for the next change.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
