/P 95 0 R
/E <5A696D6F756E2085204D6F64756C617220536F756E64205363756C70747572657320286F6E676F696E6729>
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
189 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 95 0 R
/E (Zimoun is a Swiss artist who builds large installations from simple, repeated components motors, wires, cardboard boxes that together create complex and evolving soundscapes. What connected his work to ours is the modular logic: one unit does one thing, but combine several and the system becomes something qualitatively different. That is exactly what we were building. His work also lives at the intersection of the physical and the sonic, which felt very close to our own approach.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
