/Title (The storyboard was one of the first things the group created. Its job was to map out the emotional journey of the piece  from emptiness, through life and connection, and finally to collapse. Before any of the technical work came together, the storyboard gave everyone a shared sense of how the experience should feel and where it was going dramatically.)
