/Title (As the project developed, the interaction model grew richer than the storyboard originally suggested. Rather than only responding to combinations, the system was built to recognise each individual cuboid on its own. This gave the audience something more exploratory  they could discover what each celestial body looked and sounded like alone before starting to connect them.)
